<title>USA: Atlantic Dairy members approve merger with Land O' Lakes.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Dairy members approve merger with Land O' Lakes.</headline>
<dateline>LANCASTER, Pa. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Dairy Cooperative said Thursday its members approved a plan to merge with Land O'Lakes, setting in motion a formal merger of the two cooperatives as of April 1.</p>
<p>Members of the Land O'Lakes food and agricultural cooperative had already voted in favour of the proposal Feb. 20.</p>
<p>Land O'Lakes, based in Arden Hills, Minn., manufactures and markets a wide variety of food products. The merger will extend the cooperatives' production and marketing capabilities from coast to coast, Atlantic Dairy said.</p>
</text>
